OL,3,GNEWSAInvesting #10m in theatre a 'no
OL,4,Abrainer', council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FCabinet member for wellbeing, culture
OL,7,Fand green spaces Anthony Frankland said
OL,8,Finvesting in the arts always yielded an
OL,9,F"enormous payback".
